[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "startSeconds": 0.0,
    "endSeconds": 2.63,
    "text": "You have been listening, the spirit said.",
    "charStart": 0,
    "charEnd": 41
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "startSeconds": 2.63,
    "endSeconds": 6.98,
    "text": "Yes, said Koriang, because there was no point in lying.",
    "charStart": 43,
    "charEnd": 98
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "startSeconds": 6.98,
    "endSeconds": 13.45,
    "text": "Most men hear something they don't understand and they walk away from it or try to destroy it, the spirit said.",
    "charStart": 100,
    "charEnd": 211
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "startSeconds": 13.45,
    "endSeconds": 15.34,
    "text": "You sat down and listened.",
    "charStart": 212,
    "charEnd": 238
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "startSeconds": 15.34,
    "endSeconds": 17.48,
    "text": "That is why I'll teach you.",
    "charStart": 239,
    "charEnd": 266
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "startSeconds": 17.48,
    "endSeconds": 20.81,
    "text": "The spirit showed Koriang the instrument.",
    "charStart": 268,
    "charEnd": 309
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "startSeconds": 20.81,
    "endSeconds": 26.97,
    "text": "A gourd — large, resonant, with the quality of something that wants to amplify rather than contain.",
    "charStart": 311,
    "charEnd": 410
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "startSeconds": 26.97,
    "endSeconds": 29.93,
    "text": "Cow skin stretched across one face of it.",
    "charStart": 411,
    "charEnd": 452
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "startSeconds": 29.93,
    "endSeconds": 31.75,
    "text": "A long hardwood neck.",
    "charStart": 453,
    "charEnd": 474
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "startSeconds": 31.75,
    "endSeconds": 39.39,
    "text": "And strings — twenty-one strings — running over a bridge set at the centre of the skin, dividing the instrument into registers.",
    "charStart": 475,
    "charEnd": 602
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "startSeconds": 39.39,
    "endSeconds": 42.42,
    "text": "The spirit showed Koriang how to hold it.",
    "charStart": 604,
    "charEnd": 645
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "startSeconds": 42.42,
    "endSeconds": 47.49,
    "text": "How to pluck the strings with his thumbs and forefingers while his fingers wrapped around the neck.",
    "charStart": 646,
    "charEnd": 745
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "startSeconds": 47.49,
    "endSeconds": 54.25,
    "text": "How the instrument wanted to be played — not forced, not struck, but coaxed, addressed, spoken to.",
    "charStart": 746,
    "charEnd": 844
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "startSeconds": 54.25,
    "endSeconds": 56.95,
    "text": "It is not an instrument, the spirit said.",
    "charStart": 846,
    "charEnd": 887
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "startSeconds": 56.95,
    "endSeconds": 60.18,
    "text": "It is a voice.",
    "charStart": 888,
    "charEnd": 902
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "startSeconds": 60.18,
    "endSeconds": 64.2,
    "text": "You must learn to speak with it.",
    "charStart": 903,
    "charEnd": 935
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "startSeconds": 64.2,
    "endSeconds": 66.84,
    "text": "Koriang sat with the spirit in that clearing until dawn.",
    "charStart": 937,
    "charEnd": 993
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "startSeconds": 66.84,
    "endSeconds": 70.93,
    "text": "And when the light began to come through the trees, the spirit placed the kora in Koriang's hands and said:",
    "charStart": 994,
    "charEnd": 1101
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "startSeconds": 70.93,
    "endSeconds": 72.5,
    "text": "Take this home.",
    "charStart": 1103,
    "charEnd": 1118
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "startSeconds": 72.5,
    "endSeconds": 73.7,
    "text": "Teach your children.",
    "charStart": 1119,
    "charEnd": 1139
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "startSeconds": 73.7,
    "endSeconds": 75.21,
    "text": "They will teach theirs.",
    "charStart": 1140,
    "charEnd": 1163
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "startSeconds": 75.21,
    "endSeconds": 79.72,
    "text": "And this voice will speak for your people for as long as your people have memory.",
    "charStart": 1164,
    "charEnd": 1245
  }
]